   "can_fail_because": "Change 'str(m.get(\"id\") or m.get(\"slug\") or m.get(\"name\") or \"?\")' to 'str(m.get(\"id\", \"?\"))' \u2192 (i) becomes 'a, ?, ?, ?, raw' red; or 'ids[:6]' \u2192 'ids[:5]' \u2192 (ii) red; or 'f_at[:10]' \u2192 'f_at' \u2192 (iii) prints the full timestamp red; or REPORTED \u2192 VERIFIED on that return \u2192 all three red."
  },
  {
   "id": "RT-05",
